        "pseudocode": "Input: State space \u03b1, setoid \u03c1, map f, initial state x\nOutput: Collision pair (m, n) with m < n \u2264 |\u03b1/\u03c1|\n\n1. seen = {}\n2. For i = 0 to |\u03b1/\u03c1|:\n     c = equiv_class(f^i(x))\n     If c \u2208 seen: Return (seen[c], i)\n     seen[c] = i\n3. // Guaranteed by theorem \u2014 should never reach here\n\nTime:  O(|\u03b1/\u03c1|) expected\nSpace: O(|\u03b1/\u03c1|)"
