        "pseudocode": "CHECK-AVOIDANCE(F, T):\n  for each pair (x, y) \u2208 T \u00d7 T with x \u2260 y:\n    separated \u2190 false\n    for i = 1 to n:\n      if \u00acc\u1d62(x, y): separated \u2190 true; break\n    if not separated: return (false, (x, y))\n  return (true, \u2205)\n\nComplexity: O(|T|\u00b2 \u00b7 n \u00b7 cost(congruence_check))"
